---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Cookie Policy — DCS Y2K">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[820px] p-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="h-display mb-4 text-[56px] md:text-[72px]">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="eyebrow mb-12 border-b border-ink pb-6 text-mute">Last updated: September 23, 2026</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 leading-relaxed text-body">
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">1. What are cookies</h2>
        <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help websites remember information about your visit, such as items in your shopping bag.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">2. Cookies we use</h2>
        <p>We use essential cookies to keep your shopping bag and session working, and limited analytics cookies to understand how the site is used. We do not use cookies for third-party advertising.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">3. Managing cookies</h2>
        <p>You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. Disabling essential cookies may affect features like your shopping bag.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="h-display mb-3 text-[26px]">4. Your consent</h2>
        <p>Under GDPR, we only set non-essential cookies with your consent. Essential cookies required for the site to function are set automatically.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold">5. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about our use of cookies can be sent through our <a href="#" class="font-semibold underline">Contact us</a> page.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
